    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic 24-point game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to use the four arithmetic operations of addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division to combine the randomly given 4 cards (value between 1 and 13). Each number must be used and can only be used once. If the final calculation result equals 24, you can score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The thinking time for each question is limited, and you need to use your brain to solve the problem as soon as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For each question you solve, a little bit of thinking time will be added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, the difficulty will gradually increase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beginning, only cards from A to 10 will appear, and later, cards from A to K will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's see how long you can hold on!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic 24-point game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to use the four arithmetic operations of addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division to combine the randomly given 4 cards (value between 1 and 13). Each number must be used and can only be used once. If the final calculation result equals 24, you can score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The thinking time for each question is limited, and you need to use your brain to solve the problem as soon as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For each question you solve, a little bit of thinking time will be added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, the difficulty will gradually increase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beginning, only cards from A to 10 will appear, and later, cards from A to K will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's see how long you can hold on!</p>",
